Name[ru]=Запуск приложений Windows (Sadeem)
Name[pt]=Executor de Aplicações Windows (Sadeem)
Name[it]=Avviatore applicazioni Windows (Sadeem)
Name[zh]=Windows 应用程序运行器 (Sadeem)
Name[zh_CN]=Windows 应用程序运行器 (Sadeem)
Comment=Run and install Windows applications and games seamlessly
Comment[ar]=تشغيل وتثبيت برامج وألعاب ويندوز بسلاسة عبر بيئة سديم
Comment[en]=Run and install Windows applications and games seamlessly via Sadeem
Comment[fr]=Exécutez et installez des applications et des jeux Windows en toute transparence via Sadeem
Comment[es]=Ejecute e instale aplicaciones y juegos de Windows sin problemas a través de Sadeem
Comment[de]=Windows-Programme und -Spiele nahtlos über Sadeem ausführen und installieren
