Comment[ru]=Простой запуск и установка приложений и игр Windows через среду Sadeem
Comment[pt]=Execute e instale aplicações e jogos do Windows de forma integrada através do Sadeem
Comment[it]=Esegui e installa applicazioni e giochi Windows senza problemi tramite Sadeem
Comment[zh]=通过 Sadeem 环境无缝运行和安装 Windows 应用程序与游戏
Comment[zh_CN]=通过 Sadeem 环境无缝运行和安装 Windows 应用程序与游戏
Exec=/usr/bin/sadeem-windows-exe-handler %U
Icon=application-x-ms-dos-executable
Terminal=false
Categories=System;Emulator;
StartupNotify=true
NoDisplay=false
MimeType=application/x-ms-dos-executable;application/vnd.microsoft.portable-executable;application/x-msdownload;application/x-msi;
